                                                "text": "Since retiring from athletics, he has developed a paunch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c1b1d22-7291-4c89-8e2c-d139cd264178",
                                                "sense_id": "53855708-d0b7-3fec-ac56-0dfc0f66ad6d",
